			(property "Description" "u-blox NEO-D9S\n\nThe NEO-D9S can receive the data stream of a GNSS correction service, broadcast via satellite L band and compliant to the specification the product is designed for. Integrated with a high precision GNSS receiver, such as from the u-blox F9 platform, it enables the positioning system to reach down to centimeter-level accuracy."
